      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/uwabambiling/ecommerce-tailwind-fontawesome-pexels\n\n### Category\n\nJS\n\n### Project Title\n\nModern e-commerce website template built with Tailwind, Font Awesome, and Pexels.\n\n### Project Description\n\nThis project provides a professional, responsive e-commerce website template using Tailwind CSS for rapid styling, Font Awesome for iconography, and Pexels for high-quality imagery. The template features a homepage, product grid, hero banner, navigation, and footer, designed for easy customization and scalability. Ideal for beginners and developers seeking a solid foundation for online shops or portfolio projects.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- Fully responsive with Tailwind CSS\n- Integrated Font Awesome icons\n- Beautiful imagery from Pexels\n- Modular React components for homepage, product grid, hero section, and footer\n- Easy to customize and extend for real-world e-commerce needs.\n\n### Example Code\n\n```markdown\n// Example: src/components/Navbar.jsx\nimport React from 'react';\nexport default function Navbar() {\n  return (\n    <nav className=\"bg-white shadow flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-4\">\n      <span className=\"text-xl font-bold\">ShopLogo</span>\n      <div className=\"flex gap-4 items-center\">\n        <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Home</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Products</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" className=\"hover:text-blue-600\">Contact</a>\n        <i className=\"fas fa-shopping-cart text-xl\"></i>\n      </div>\n    </nav>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\nhttps://www.pexels.com/photo/gray-and-black-laptop-computer-showing-e-commerce-1779486/",
